# Postplan review artifacts. Local HTML is a source for the hosted postplan
# URL, not a durable deliverable. Keep intermediate renders and scratch
# comment drafts out of git. Finished postplans live at their postplan.dev URL
# and are linked from PR comments per docs/contributing/creating-a-postplan.md.
artifacts/
